    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.social/@Gargron/117118406031556416</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.social/@Gargron/117118406031556416</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 20:30:52 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;For the time being it won&amp;#39;t be possible to buy &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/Mastodon" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Mastodon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; merch from EU countries besides Germany. Only Germany, Switzerland, UK, and USA. And new plushies are coming in like two months. Not ideal.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <category>mastodon</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.social/@Gargron/117117948687283302</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.social/@Gargron/117117948687283302</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:34:34 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p class="quote-inline"&gt;RE: &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/@Mastodon/117117221397911074" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" translate="no"&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="ellipsis"&gt;mastodon.social/@Mastodon/1171&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="invisible"&gt;17221397911074&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After hearing feedback from people struggling with &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/Mastodon" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Mastodon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;’s layout and navigation for a long time I’m really looking forward to these changes. And I’m really impressed with the work &lt;span class="h-card" translate="no"&gt;&lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/@imanijoy" class="u-url mention"&gt;@&lt;span&gt;imanijoy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; has put into researching user needs with surveys, interviews, and round tables. I feel like the community has never been so represented in the design process before. The screenshots are marked “in progress” for a reason though—it’s a process.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <category>mastodon</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.social/@Gargron/117117350535420190</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.social/@Gargron/117117350535420190</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 16:02:27 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I’ve been dealing with &lt;a href="https://mastodon.social/tags/PPWR" class="mention hashtag" rel="tag"&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PPWR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; compliance for Mastodon’s merch shop and frankly I don’t see how this regulation doesn’t just eradicate all small business within the EU. This is a self-goal if I’ve ever seen one.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <category>PPWR</category>
    </item>
